108
00:04:36,060 --> 00:04:37,795
D message is going to print

109
00:04:37,795 --> 00:04:42,360
the kernel message as well
from proc, k message.

110
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,630
This is another way
that you'd be able

111
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:44,950
to get the content of

112
00:04:44,950 --> 00:04:48,285
